# `bro` — Developer Productivity CLI

## Overview

`k` is a personal developer productivity CLI built in Go that reduces daily friction around commit messages, repetitive terminal commands, standup summaries, and general AI-assisted problem solving. It's designed to be opinionated for personal use but configurable enough for public distribution.

---

## V1 Scope

### Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `bro commit` | Generate smart commit messages from staged changes |
| `bro run` | Fuzzy-searchable command shortcuts with direct alias support |
| `bro standup` | Generate daily standup summary from git activity, output to markdown |
| `bro ask` | General-purpose LLM queries with stdin/pipe support |
| `bro config` | Manage configuration (profiles, API keys, shortcuts) |

