## Tech Stack

| Component | Choice | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Language | Go | Fast, single binary, cross-platform |
| CLI framework | [cobra](https://github.com/spf13/cobra) | Industry standard for Go CLIs |
| Config management | [viper](https://github.com/spf13/viper) | Works seamlessly with cobra, supports YAML |
| Interactive prompts | [bubbletea](https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea) | Terminal UI framework for the fuzzy picker, interactive commit flow |
| Fuzzy filtering | [go-fuzzyfinder](https://github.com/ktr0731/go-fuzzyfinder) or bubbletea custom | For `bro run` list |
| Styling/colors | [lipgloss](https://github.com/charmbracelet/lipgloss) | Pretty terminal output, pairs with bubbletea |
| LLM clients | `net/http` or official SDKs | Direct HTTP keeps dependencies light |
| Git operations | `os/exec` calling git | Simpler and more reliable than go-git for our use case |
| Distribution | `go install` + Homebrew tap | Free, standard Go distribution |

