## V2+ Roadmap (For Reference)

- **Daemon mode**: `bro daemon start/stop/status` — background activity tracking via launchd
- **Activity tracking**: Polls git repos, tracks directory time, stores in local SQLite
- **Auto-summary**: End-of-day automatic standup generation
- **Export integrations**: Push standups to Apple Notes, Notion, Google Docs
- **PR description generator**: `bro pr` — generate PR descriptions from branch diff
- **Snippet manager**: `bro snippet` — save/retrieve frequently used commands and code
- **Environment switcher**: `bro env staging` — switch GCP project, k8s context, DB in one command
- **Plugin system**: Allow community extensions

